      "topic": "Functions",
      "subtopic": "Even and odd",
      "difficulty": 3,
      "kind": "template",
      "statement": "Determine whether $f(x) = {{a}}x^{{{2*m}}} {{signed(b)}}$ is even, odd, or neither.",
      "answer": "Even.",
      "solution": "$f(-x) = {{a}}(-x)^{{{2*m}}} {{signed(b)}} = {{a}}x^{{{2*m}}} {{signed(b)}} = f(x)$, because an even power kills the sign. A function with only even powers and a constant is even.",
