      "kind": "template",
      "statement": "Evaluate $\\sin\\left(\\dfrac{ {{k}}\\pi }{ 6 }\\right)$ exactly.",
      "answer": "${{ifelse(k < 6, frac(1,2), frac(-1,2))}}$",
      "solution": "$\\dfrac{ {{k}}\\pi }{6}$ is a reference angle of $\\dfrac{\\pi}{6}$, where the sine has magnitude $\\dfrac{1}{2}$. The sign comes from the quadrant: sine is positive above the $x$-axis and negative below it.",
